Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.05,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(372,193.556)}裤头村\N水母创伤\N康复中心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.05,注释,,0,0,0,,翻译  1440kHz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.16,0:01:16.02,画面内容,,0,0,0,,{\pos(607,154.667)}一点东西
Dialogue: 1,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,﻿你好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.52,0:00:03.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Hello there
Dialogue: 1,0:00:03.59,0:00:07.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,欢迎来到裤头村水母创伤康复中心
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.59,0:00:07.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the Bikini Bottom Jellyfish Trauma Center
Dialogue: 1,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.26,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我们进去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.16,0:00:08.26,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Let's go inside
Dialogue: 1,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这些可怜的灵魂之所以在这
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.89,0:00:11.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,These poor souls are here
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.43,0:00:12.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,疼死了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.43,0:00:12.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It burns
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.00,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,是因为他们
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.06,0:00:13.00,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,because they found themselves
Dialogue: 1,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不小心碰到了水母触手会蜇人的一端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.00,0:00:15.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,on the wrong side of a jellyfish stinger--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.76,0:00:17.30,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,虽然触手没有不蜇人的一端
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.76,0:00:17.30,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,not that there's a right side
Dialogue: 1,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.24,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,重点在于  我们应该要尊重
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.24,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,The point is that we should always be respectful--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:23.14,0:00:24.07,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,踩到了个腌椰菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.14,0:00:24.07,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Stepped on a pickle
Dialogue: 1,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,腌什么菜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.07,0:00:24.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Pickle?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我才不是腌椰菜  你个
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.24,0:00:26.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm not a pickle, you--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.31,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,小心点  呆头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.08,0:00:29.31,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Careful, oaf
Dialogue: 1,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.21,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,那腌椰菜是痞老板啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.08,0:00:31.21,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,That pickle is Plankton
Dialogue: 1,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.11,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.45,0:00:32.11,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:32.35,0:00:35.12,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这里可是水母创伤康复中心  白痴
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.35,0:00:35.12,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This is the Jellyfish Trauma Center, dunce
Dialogue: 1,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.22,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,不然你以为我怎么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.12,0:00:36.22,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,What do you think happened--
Dialogue: 1,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.55,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,你这可怜的小宝贝
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.52,0:00:37.55,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,You poor dear
Dialogue: 1,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.32,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,送你点鲜花
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.55,0:00:38.32,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,have some flowers
Dialogue: 1,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.79,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我对菊花过敏
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.89,0:00:41.79,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm allergic to chrysanthemums
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.19,0:00:44.89,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,护士
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.19,0:00:44.89,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Nurse
Dialogue: 1,0:00:44.89,0:00:46.16,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,这根热狗需要救助
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.89,0:00:46.16,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,This hot dog needs help
Dialogue: 1,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.03,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,交给我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.16,0:00:47.03,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I'm on it
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,派大星  你来干嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.40,0:00:48.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Patrick, what are you doing here?
Dialogue: 1,0:00:49.20,0:00:50.43,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,被罚来做社区服务了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.20,0:00:50.43,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Community service
Dialogue: 1,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.87,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,说来话长
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.43,0:00:51.87,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,It's a long story
Dialogue: 1,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.40,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我需要一点帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.70,0:00:54.40,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Could use a little help here
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.94,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,起码我不会被那群野蛮人给害了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.44,0:01:01.94,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Well, at least I'm safe from those savages
Dialogue: 1,0:01:06.82,0:01:07.88,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,妈啊
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.82,0:01:07.88,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Mommy
Dialogue: 1,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.48,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,别蜇眼睛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.42,0:01:09.48,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Not the eye
Dialogue: 1,0:01:11.89,0:01:14.76,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,我想我们大家在这都学到了一点东西
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.89,0:01:14.76,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,I think we've all learned something here today
Dialogue: 1,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.06,标准-Chi,,0,0,0,,感谢收看
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.96,0:01:16.06,标准-Eng,,0,0,0,,Thanks for watching
